    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d604">

                <pb facs="0670" n="412" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg412"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72112/1168</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Page</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1371]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 11, 1915</hi>.</date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received May 24.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Adverting to my despatch No. 1312 of April
                        30,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d604-f1"/> in which I enclosed to the Department a
                    copy of a memorandum dated April 26 which I left with Sir Edward Grey on the
                    28th ultimo, in relation to the detention of American ships and cargoes by the
                    British authorities, I now have the honor to transmit herewith for the
                    information of the Department a copy of a note under date of May 10, <pb
                        facs="0671" n="413" xml:id="pg413"/> which I have received from Sir Edward
                    Grey in reply to the above-mentioned memorandum.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Walter Hines Page</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d604-a1.xml" xpointer="d604-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
